{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 21,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Faith Triumphs in Trouble"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, having been justified by faith, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Some ancient mss. let us have"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "we have peace with God through our Lord Jesus Christ, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "through whom also we have access by faith into this grace in which we stand, and rejoice in hope of the glory of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And not only "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " but we also glory in tribulations, knowing that tribulation produces "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "endurance"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "perseverance; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and perseverance, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "approved character"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "character; and character, hope. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now hope does not disappoint, because the love of God has been poured out in our hearts by the Holy Spirit who was given to us."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Christ in Our Place"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For when we were still without strength, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "at the right time"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in due time Christ died for the ungodly. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For scarcely for a righteous man will one die; yet perhaps for a good man someone would even dare to die. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But God demonstrates His own love toward us, in that while we were still sinners, Christ died for us. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Much more then, having now been justified by His blood, we shall be saved from wrath through Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if when we were enemies we were reconciled to God through the death of His Son, much more, having been reconciled, we shall be saved by His life. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And not only "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " but we also rejoice in God through our Lord Jesus Christ, through whom we have now received the reconciliation."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Death in Adam, Life in Christ"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, just as through one man sin entered the world, and death through sin, and thus death spread to all men, because all sinned— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "(For until the law sin was in the world, but sin is not imputed when there is no law. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nevertheless death reigned from Adam to Moses, even over those who had not sinned according to the likeness of the transgression of Adam, who is a type of Him who was to come. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the free gift "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not like the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "trespass or false step"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "offense. For if by the one man’s offense many died, much more the grace of God and the gift by the grace of the one Man, Jesus Christ, abounded to many. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the gift "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not like "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that which came"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " through the one who sinned. For the judgment "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "which came"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "offense resulted"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in condemnation, but the free gift "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "which came"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from many "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "trespasses"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "offenses "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "resulted"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in justification. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if by the one man’s "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "trespass"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "offense death reigned through the one, much more those who receive abundance of grace and of the gift of righteousness will reign in life through the One, Jesus Christ.)"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, as through "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or one trespass"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "one man’s offense "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "judgment came"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to all men, resulting in condemnation, even so through one"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or one righteous act"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Man’s righteous act "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the free gift came"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to all men, resulting in justification of life. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For as by one man’s disobedience many were made sinners, so also by one Man’s obedience many will be made righteous."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moreover the law entered that the offense might abound. But where sin abounded, grace abounded much more, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "so that as sin reigned in death, even so grace might reign through righteousness to eternal life through Jesus Christ our Lord."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}